      ],
      "entries": [
        "The engerra finds words to bolster a creature's spirits. The engerra spends 10 minutes speaking with a willing creature. If that creature has the fatigued|PC1 condition, it's no longer fatigued|PC1. The creature can't benefit from any engerra's Final Words of Wisdom again for 1 year."
